  "notes": "MEDICAL TERM:\n{嘔|おう} (vomit) + {吐|と} (spit out) - formal/medical term for vomiting.\n\nVERB FORM:\n- {嘔吐|おうと}する (to vomit)\n\nCOMMON/CASUAL ALTERNATIVES:\n- {吐|は}く (to throw up - common)\n- {戻|もど}す (to vomit - euphemistic)\n- ゲロを{吐|は}く (to puke - very casual/crude)\n\nRELATED SYMPTOMS:\n- {吐|は}き{気|け} (nausea)\n- {胃|い}もたれ (upset stomach)\n- {悪心|おしん} (nausea - medical term)",
